Contract deployment utilities for 0xSplits v1 smart contracts.

## Key Integration Pattern
- Uses ethkit library for Ethereum interactions and ABI encoding
- Embeds contract ABI and bytecode at compile time for reliability
- Provides chain-specific default contract addresses

## Important Constraints
- Requires private key configuration for deployment operations
- Contract deployment waits for transaction confirmation with 10-minute timeout
- Gas limit defaults to 2940439 but is configurable